+Embedded presentation hosts render the `conversation.session.chrome` factory beside `conversation.content` inside the same SessionProvider. It uses the native title, view tabs and action slots, sharing the per-Session Conversation store with the resident header and body. Only the factory declares the header's extension slots; unrelated hosts must not declare them again. The resident header delegates to this factory, preserving its existing navigation. Mounting or switching views does not create a Session or send a prompt.
